From: dingkaijian <dingkaijian@shizhuang-inc.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:08:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(server): unwrap/rewrap omp antigravity envelope for
 google bodies

omp's google-antigravity provider sends the real Gemini body inside an
{project, model, request} envelope. All google consumers read contents at
the top level, so an enveloped body resolved no conversation and died with
the #286 400. Unwrap at inbound parse (shell captured for egress), and
re-wrap the rebuilt GoogleRequestBody before forwarding. Pure helpers live
in util.ts; patch script now applies every exported 000*.patch.
